80 < 2             "context": "`path` is the file. `theirs` is every line the other side wrote in it, in order. An agent of this run, at work on `ours`, removed the lines in `lost`, which are some of them. `settled` is the whole file as this run leaves it. `sides` says what each side meant, each with a `title` and, where it has one, a `claim`. Judge the lines in `lost` one by one, and only them. A line that this run's own work made needless is still gone."
81 < 2           },
